{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new Battle Royale Game, I have played every battle royale game, and honestly, I wanted to make one myself and tailor it completely for the players, so I did. I apologize as I am the only one working on the game, my wife is pregnant and I also have a full-time job, I am releasing this in hopes to get the funds to complete this game in its entirety withing the next year or two years. I will focus heavily on all player feedback. Any cheating discovered will not be tolerated and your game license will be revoked. For me to get controller working I had to manage the game properties by right clicking the game in my library on steam, go to controller, and disable steam input.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538920?t=1752911795","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538920?t=1752911795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538920/03cc5e9677ff57d44fa24ae32acb70d99a4eecf6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752911795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538920/03cc5e9677ff57d44fa24ae32acb70d99a4eecf6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752911795","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"shooting and gun violence"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new Battle Royale Game, I have played every battle royale game, and honestly, I wanted to make one myself and tailor it completely for the players, so I did. I apologize as I am the only one working on the game, my wife is pregnant and I also have a full-time job, I am releasing this in hopes to get the funds to complete this game in its entirety withing the next year or two years. I will focus heavily on all player feedback. Any cheating discovered will not be tolerated and your game license will be revoked. For me to get controller working I had to manage the game properties by right clicking the game in my library on steam, go to controller, and disable steam input.</p>","developers":[" BeadleGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538920/1fd925e23544a78e666b94ee2ba1d77f58efeff9/header.jpg?t=1752911795","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3538920/724310414/691c977cce288fc20e1c36dcb4f4ad7286739d46/1750859163/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749534662","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3538920/724310414/691c977cce288fc20e1c36dcb4f4ad7286739d46/1750859163/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749534662","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3538920/724310414/691c977cce288fc20e1c36dcb4f4ad7286739d46/1750859163/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749534662","id":257141422,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141422/movie480.mp4?t=1749534662","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141422/movie_max.mp4?t=1749534662"},"name":"LatestPlaythrough","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257141422/40dda0d177d43ce52d92a4f970b54c2a3c2fa1cf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749534662","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2571